 through the monitor.\n\nFor some reason, manually turning the monitor off, doesn't produce this error message even though all audio stops.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start Godot editor \n2. Put Windows to sleep\n3. Wake up --> Error message\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109055/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109055/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}